# App Store release notes

When merging `dev` into `release`, write the merge commit **body** as App Store "What's New" (see `AGENTS.md`).

- User-visible bullets only (features, fixes, behavior)
- No files, types, PRs, SHAs, or "refactor" talk
- 2–8 short lines, under 4000 characters
- CI uploads that body as the store description
